WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.834
"I'm Derby," the driver said.

2
00:00:04.835 --> 00:00:08.513
"I deliver packages.

3
00:00:08.514 --> 00:00:15.061
My spaceship crashed."

4
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:25.027
"We'll help," Ringo said.

5
00:00:25.028 --> 00:00:32.251
He and Bot fixed Derby's spaceship.

6
00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:35.220
"Thanks!" Derby said.

7
00:00:35.221 --> 00:00:38.884
"Can you help the Freezies?" Ringo asked.

8
00:00:38.885 --> 00:00:41.868
"They must move to Planet Ice.

9
00:00:41.869 --> 00:00:44.680
But their ship is broken."

10
00:00:44.681 --> 00:00:47.359
Derby nodded. "Sure.

11
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.349
I have to go to Space Patrol base too.

12
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.699
I've got packages to deliver."

13
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.378
"Oh!" Ringo said. "That's why—"

14
00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:01.642
Splash! The spacefish leaped up to the ice.

15
00:01:01.643 --> 00:01:04.986
Boom! It cracked the ice.

16
00:01:04.987 --> 00:01:12.104
Ringo's spaceship fell into the sea.

17
00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:15.808
"Get in my ship!" Derby said.

18
00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:21.587
Ringo and Bot hurried inside.

19
00:01:21.588 --> 00:01:25.953
"Blast off!" Derby said.

20
00:01:25.954 --> 00:01:34.306
The spacefish snapped at the ship.

21
00:01:34.307 --> 00:01:38.122
"We must get rid of that fish!" Ringo said.

22
00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:44.366
Derby looked around. "Throw that box to it!"

23
00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.238
Ringo threw the box.

24
00:01:47.239 --> 00:01:53.627
The spacefish dived after it.

25
00:01:53.628 --> 00:01:56.348
"What's in there?" Ringo asked.

26
00:01:56.349 --> 00:02:05.351
Derby grinned. "Tasty space jerky!"

27
00:02:05.352 --> 00:02:14.318
The Freezies climbed into Derby's ship.

28
00:02:14.319 --> 00:02:30.239
"Next stop, Planet Ice," Derby said.

29
00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:35.504
Ringo opened the package from his mom.

30
00:02:35.505 --> 00:02:40.289
Lucy tried on her new sneakers.

31
00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.871
Captain Nova scratched her head.

32
00:02:42.872 --> 00:02:56.914
"Hmm. I wonder where my space jerky is."

